<title>HONG KONG: UBS issues warrants on basket of HK prop stocks.</title>
<headline>UBS issues warrants on basket of HK prop stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland, Hong Kong branch, said on Monday it was issuing 300 million American-style call warrants on a basket of Hong Kong-listed property stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd		0.038 shrs</p>
<p> Henderson Land Development Co Ltd     0.04  shrs</p>
<p> Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd	     0.03  shrs</p>
<p> New World Development Co Ltd	    0.058 shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE   HK$10.0269	PREMIUM	    9.80 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE    HK $0.2206	GEARING	    5.05X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION     05.MAY.98	 PAYDATE	    20.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	  22.MAY.97	 MIN EXER LOT     10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE HK$11.141</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6933</p>
</text>
